WEBVTT

00:00:55.968 --> 00:01:02.600
that far exceed what we would need
to power the world thousands of times over

00:01:02.642 --> 00:01:04.852
for all of civilization.

00:01:05.561 --> 00:01:07.063
Pretty cool, right?

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:10.900
So we got to get to it.

00:01:10.942 --> 00:01:12.193
How do we do that?

00:01:12.193 --> 00:01:14.195
Let's tap it. Let's tap it fast.

00:01:14.195 --> 00:01:15.404
I'm a climate activist.

00:01:15.446 --> 00:01:18.199
I am very worried about climate change.

00:01:18.199 --> 00:01:19.742
It keeps me up at night.

00:01:19.742 --> 00:01:22.245
So we need to make this happen, right?

00:01:22.703 --> 00:01:23.871
So how?

00:01:24.664 --> 00:01:28.835
So I'm here with good news
about that and also a proposition.

00:01:28.876 --> 00:01:30.378
Let's do the good news first.